033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"尒朱兆","kind":"person","person_id":"nbh_vlu_zv2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"榮部渡馬渚與後入洛，完整莊帝／榮事件承接。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"侃","kind":"person","person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子侃正文停柩及襲華陰伯；下完整侃傳、同北史士業與裴邃／濟河／韋義遠事件。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"天光","kind":"person","person_id":"hhk_kr8_h9p","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"大都督西伐及普泰關西借韋義遠招侃後七月害之，同事主線。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0067","start":67,"end":68,"surface":"侃","kind":"person","person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子侃正文停柩及襲華陰伯；下完整侃傳、同北史士業與裴邃／濟河／韋義遠事件。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"子婦","kind":"person","person_id":"rwe_ukz_s8s","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子婦是侃未名兒子的妻，父韋義遠明；不指定其夫師沖或純陀。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0071","start":71,"end":74,"surface":"韋義遠","kind":"person","person_id":"x0d_y49_0ry","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"天光遣侃子婦父韋義遠招慰之，父關係只到該未名子婦，不推侃妻。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0085","start":85,"end":86,"surface":"侃","kind":"person","person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子侃正文停柩及襲華陰伯；下完整侃傳、同北史士業與裴邃／濟河／韋義遠事件。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0088","start":88,"end":89,"surface":"昱","kind":"person","person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAABA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"侃從兄昱勸赴天光；本卷後椿子昱字元晷並父椿可供近系橋，本批僅同源從兄，不推共同祖父。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0095","start":95,"end":96,"surface":"侃","kind":"person","person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子侃正文停柩及襲華陰伯；下完整侃傳、同北史士業與裴邃／濟河／韋義遠事件。"},{"i